00:05:13.348 --> 00:05:15.111
These things have grabbed more attention.

00:05:15.111 --> 00:05:17.106
YouTube and Vine
celebrities are bigger than

00:05:17.106 --> 00:05:19.443
real celebrities to the
13 to 18 year old demo,

00:05:19.443 --> 00:05:23.082
