the medium you're best at.

00:05:25.517 --> 00:05:28.225
Some people rock Vine,
some people rock Snapchat.

00:05:28.225 --> 00:05:29.662
If you're good at taking
pictures and drawing

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:32.104
