00:05:35.899 --> 00:05:38.247
Instagram, we've seen a
whole emergence of stars,

00:05:38.247 --> 00:05:41.221
curators, people of talent and so just

00:05:41.221 --> 00:05:43.271
more new avenues

00:05:43.271 --> 00:05:47.066
are coming out and so,
just more of the same,

00:05:47.066 --> 00:05:48.836
